        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game-breaking version of Pro Strategy Football changes everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation now has real jersey numbers!  Shoulder numbers are optional, to reflect real jerseys throughout history, and the shoulder numbers and jersey numbers can be colored differently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate and realistic formations by era!  HUGE jump in realism and immersiveness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can now manually trade players and draft picks for even more player movement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Season Logs! View every season log for your favorite (or hated) players. Drill down to see how he did in a season, and then click any game to view the stats and watch any play or drive (watch the whole game if you want!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career Record Books! Year-by-year or All-time best seasons! Tons of categories! Click on any leader and jump immediately to his season logs for that season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUGE overhaul to Highlights! You can now view ANY drive and ANY play of any game! Relive game-winning drives and key plays, even entire games! Perfect for reliving key drives from every season! Configure highlights to watch the ones YOU want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlights mode is better than ever!  You can still step through key highlights, but now you can configure the highlights!  Even better, you can step through drives and plays!  You can even start at the beginning (or start in any drive) and watch as much of the game as you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can now filter Weekly and Studio games by conference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose alternate uniforms and helmets!  Play at a neutral site!  Use team-specific and championship-specific screen backgrounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and import smaller draft pools! This will allow users to create historic draft pools and import them - change history!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can create team-specific (and championship-specific) background screens for Game Setup and Game Summary screens!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of career records, player season logs, and the new ability to watch any play of any game bring hundreds of hours of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game-breaking version of Pro Strategy Football changes everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation now has real jersey numbers!  Shoulder numbers are optional, to reflect real jerseys throughout history, and the shoulder numbers and jersey numbers can be colored differently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate and realistic formations by era!  HUGE jump in realism and immersiveness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can now manually trade players and draft picks for even more player movement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Season Logs! View every season log for your favorite (or hated) players. Drill down to see how he did in a season, and then click any game to view the stats and watch any play or drive (watch the whole game if you want!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career Record Books! Year-by-year or All-time best seasons! Tons of categories! Click on any leader and jump immediately to his season logs for that season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUGE overhaul to Highlights! You can now view ANY drive and ANY play of any game! Relive game-winning drives and key plays, even entire games! Perfect for reliving key drives from every season! Configure highlights to watch the ones YOU want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlights mode is better than ever!  You can still step through key highlights, but now you can configure the highlights!  Even better, you can step through drives and plays!  You can even start at the beginning (or start in any drive) and watch as much of the game as you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can now filter Weekly and Studio games by conference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose alternate uniforms and helmets!  Play at a neutral site!  Use team-specific and championship-specific screen backgrounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and import smaller draft pools! This will allow users to create historic draft pools and import them - change history!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can create team-specific (and championship-specific) background screens for Game Setup and Game Summary screens!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of career records, player season logs, and the new ability to watch any play of any game bring hundreds of hours of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Game-breaking PSF now includes upgraded animation, trading players &amp; draft picks, league records, player season logs, and the ability to relive past games - watch game-winning drives and key plays! Realistic formations for all eras! Alternate uniforms!",
